00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:46.650
And in those extreme contradictions

00:09:46.650 --> 00:09:50.710
I think I became the enigma
or anomaly that I am.

00:09:50.710 --> 00:09:52.980
Now there's also some DNA in that,

00:09:52.980 --> 00:09:57.980
meaning a lot of people (sound cuts out)

00:10:01.100 --> 00:10:02.330
both my parents.

